name: ['Aether Channeler', 'Angel of Despair', 'Annex Sentry', "Archmage's Charm", 'Blazing Rootwalla', 'Cauldron Familiar', 'Dark Confidant', 'Dark Petition', 'Eidolon of the Great Revel', 'Flame Slash', 'Gifted Aetherborn', 'Gilded Goose', 'Hollow One', 'Koth, Fire of Resistance', 'Lier, Disciple of the Drowned', 'Memory Deluge', 'Moonshaker Cavalry', 'Mortify', 'Omnath, Locus of Creation', 'Spell Pierce', 'Strangle', 'Tail Swipe', 'Thalia and The Gitrog Monster', 'Transcendent Message', 'Vengevine']
